        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Michel Feher, Mark Fisher, Franco Berardi, Ann Demeester, Judith Butler, Rick Prelinger, Suely Rolnik, Michael Baldwin, Mel Ramsden, Allan Sekula, Seth Siegelaub, Kenneth Goldsmith, Fareed Armaly, Stuart Bailey, Will Holder, Xavier LeRoy, Antoni Muntadas, James Pritchett, Anri Sala, Natascha Sadr Haghighian, Vicki Bennett, John Oswald, Guy Schraenen\n- Organizations: Mediapart, Ràdio Web MACBA, Museum, Centre\n- Topics: publishing languages, blogs, interviews, media documentation\n\nFacts:\n- Michel Feher writes for a number of outlets and has a semi-regular blog with the French journal Mediapart.\n- Mediapart is published in French, English, and Spanish.\n- Ràdio Web MACBA serves as a tool to document the continuous present of the Museum.\n- Ràdio Web MACBA includes interviews with prominent figures who have passed through the Centre.\n- The people interviewed by Ràdio Web MACBA have included Michel Feher, Mark Fisher, Franco Berardi, Ann Demeester, Judith Butler, Rick Prelinger, Suely Rolnik, Michael Baldwin, Mel Ramsden, Allan Sekula, Seth Siegelaub, Kenneth Goldsmith, Fareed Armaly, Stuart Bailey, Will Holder, Xavier LeRoy, Antoni Muntadas, James Pritchett, Anri Sala, Natascha Sadr Haghighian, Vicki Bennett, John Oswald, and Guy Schraenen.",
